<title>USA: ABC Dispensing names Crate CFO.</title>
<headline>ABC Dispensing names Crate CFO.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABC Dispensing Technologies Inc said on Tuesday that consultant and turn-around specialist Walter Crate has assumed, on an interim basis, the responsibilities of chief financial officer and assistant to the president.</p>
<p>Crate succeeds Gary Salhany, who has resigned as CFO to pursue other interests, ABC said.  </p>
<p>Crate is owner of Scarborough Group, a Cleveland-based firm that specializes in acquiring troubled companies and turning them around.</p>
</text>
